# Warp from Jian's room (start save) to the statue maps at real entrances (map, entrance and facing pinned
# while walking out of the room door) and save a state at each: e12_101 Delrich Temple, e4_103
# Thieves' Woods. Run with --save. test_statue_sides needs room, test_statue_others room and e12_101.
include boot_from_save
wait 30
save room
pin u16 0x020B77EC 12
pin u16 0x020B77F2 101
pin u8 0x020B77EE 1
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
save e12_101
shot e12_101
load room
wait 5
pin u16 0x020B77EC 4
pin u16 0x020B77F2 103
pin u8 0x020B77EE 1
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
save e4_103
shot e4_103
